PHASE 6: Create Mapper
Step 11: Create Mapper
nano mapper.py

Paste:

#!/usr/bin/env python3

import sys

next(sys.stdin)

for line in sys.stdin:
    line = line.strip()
    fields = line.split(",")

    if len(fields) == 4:
        area = float(fields[3])

        if area > 0:
            print("Fire", 1)
        else:
            print("NoFire", 1)
