PHASE 7: Create Reducer
Step 12: Create Reducer
nano reducer.py

Paste:

#!/usr/bin/env python3

import sys

current_key = None
current_count = 0

for line in sys.stdin:
    key, value = line.strip().split()

    value = int(value)

    if current_key == key:
        current_count += value
    else:
        if current_key:
            print(current_key, current_count)

        current_key = key
        current_count = value

if current_key:
    print(current_key, current_count)
Save
Ctrl + O
Enter
